{'symbol': 'TMUS', 'date': '2023-01-05 15:00:00', 'title': 'T-MOBILE AND DELTA AIR LINES JOIN FORCES TO DELIVER FREE IN-FLIGHT WI-FI', 'text': 'BELLEVUE, WASH.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--TODAY, T-MOBILE (NASDAQ: TMUS) AND DELTA AIR LINES ANNOUNCED SKYMILES MEMBERS FLYING DELTA, REGARDLESS OF THEIR WIRELESS PROVIDER, CAN GET FAST, FREE WI-FI ALL FLIGHT LONG. BOTH T-MOBILE AND DELTA SHARE THE IMPORTANCE OF STAYING CONNECTED WHEREVER LIFE LEADS — EVEN AT 30,000 FEET. THIS PARTNERSHIP FUELS THE VISION FOR A MORE CONNECTED TRAVEL EXPERIENCE FOR ALL.'}